; tool-language T4 codec (borg/tool-language.borg): JSON <-> tuna trees
; through a declared type, plus the TY3 jay value encodings.  A rim
; codec (host OCaml, Yojson.Basic) with no calculus in it: the server's
; POST /api/tool/run and the CLI's --in/--out both link this library, so
; there is one type grammar and no second one (borg/local.borg L4).
(library
 (name tuna_codec)
 (modules json_codec jay_values)
 (libraries tuna tuna_interp tuna_prims yojson))
